OL,3,GNEWSAMissed chances to save boy, 2,
OL,4,Amurdered by grandparents despite dad's
OL,5,Aconcerns
OL,6,
OL,7,FMultiple agencies missed opportunities
OL,8,Fto save a two-year-old boy murdered by
OL,9,Fhis grandparents, a review has found.
OL,11,FEthan Ives-Griffiths died on 16 August
OL,12,F2021 after suffering a "catastrophic"
OL,13,Fhead injury at his grandparents' home
OL,14,Fin Garden City, Flintshire. He had been
OL,15,Fbeaten, starved, and deprived of
OL,16,Ffluids.
OL,18,FNorth Wales Safeguarding Board
OL,19,Fapologised "unreservedly" after a
OL,20,Freview found attempts by his father to
OL,21,Fraise concerns were not acted upon.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
