OL,3,GNEWSAMissed chances to save boy, 2,
OL,4,Amurdered by grandparents despite dad's
OL,5,Aconcerns
OL,6,
OL,7,FMichael Ives, 49, and Kerry Ives, 47,
OL,8,Fwere jailed for life in 2025. Ethan's
OL,9,Fmother, Shannon Ives, 29, was jailed
OL,10,Ffor 12 years for causing or allowing
OL,11,Fhis death and child cruelty.
